<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-1529] Shade fastutil in all modules where used</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-1529</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The dependency &lt;tt&gt;fastutil&lt;/tt&gt; is shaded in the module &lt;tt&gt;parquet-column&lt;/tt&gt; while also used in &lt;tt&gt;parquet-avro&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;parquet-hadoop&lt;/tt&gt;. As &lt;tt&gt;parquet-avro&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;parquet-hadoop&lt;/tt&gt; refer to the original packages of &lt;tt&gt;fastutil&lt;/tt&gt; they won&apos;t work if &lt;tt&gt;fastutil&lt;/tt&gt; is not on the classpath. Let&apos;s shade &lt;tt&gt;fastutil&lt;/tt&gt; in every module it is used.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13215277">PARQUET-1529</key>
